# The light of a tree's crown away from the noon sun (reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/crown-light.md): the
# probe of scripts/bench/fir-probe.bench (set fir-probe-4) at dusk and at night by a fire. The noon pair is that
# scenario's own. Stills only, each in the calm after a gust.
# Dusk, 21:45 (the sun set at 21:33: the sky alone lights the crown), spruce A as in fir-probe.bench:
#   dusk-far    30 m from it;
#   dusk-near   5 m from its lower boughs;
#   dusk-close  2 m from the skirt, up into the lower tiers.
# Night, 0:00, by a fire: the set carries one more file of the item layer, a light of 12 m with a flame 5.6 m
# south-west of spruce 2's trunk and 2 m over the ground - copy the set and put
# reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/crown-light-lamp.json into its worlds/NEWWORLD/vobs.d/. The fire stands
# 17 m from spruce A and does not reach it, so the dusk views are the sky's alone.
#   lamp-far      from the corner of the meadow, 25 m from spruce 2;
#   lamp-near     9.5 m from its trunk, the fire to the right in front of the crown: the lit boughs and the depth;
#   lamp-through  from the west across the crown's southern flank at the fire: the boughs between the eye and
#                 the flame, lit from behind.
# The cameras of the night stand by the spruce's place in PROBE of scripts/content/fir_set.py and by the lamp's
# file: change them together. Pair a run with OPENGOTHIC_CROWN_LIGHT=0.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set with the lamp> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh crown-light
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 21 45

goto pos 39400 3790 -2000
clear 3000
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 39550 3946 -1820 41250 4210 650
wait 6000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
set time 21 45
wait 1500
shot dusk-far
wait 200

goto pos 40550 3420 -350
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 40710 3580 -130 41250 3725 650
wait 4000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
set time 21 45
wait 1500
shot dusk-near
wait 200

cam at 40880 3555 115 41250 3775 650
wait 2000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
set time 21 45
wait 1500
shot dusk-close
wait 200

set time 0 0
goto pos 39400 3790 -2000
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 39550 3946 -1820 39650 3800 700
wait 8000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
set time 0 0
wait 1500
shot lamp-far
wait 200

cam at 39110 3740 -80 39650 3814 700
wait 3000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lamp-near
wait 200

cam at 39043 3720 877 39570 3750 147
wait 3000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot lamp-through
wait 200
